# Local environment / agent state — never belongs in the OSS repo.
# This repo dogfoods Halyard, so the maintainer's working tree
# accumulates local runtime artifacts and agent memory. Keep them out
# of version control so `git add -A` can never leak them upstream.
*.bak
*.ics
memory/
ai-schedule.*

# OS
Thumbs.db
